(footprint "C_Murata_GA3_5.7x2.8"
	(version 20221018)
	(generator "claude_ga3_gen")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Murata GA3 safety-certified (X1/Y2) MLCC, case 5.7x2.8mm (part prefix GA352), body 5.7x2.8x1.5mm max, no standard KiCad footprint exists for this case - Murata's actual datasheet/land-pattern recommendation could not be retrieved (Digikey, Murata FAQ/PDF API, alldatasheet.com, SnapEDA, and Octopart were all inaccessible) - land pattern is INTERPOLATED from KiCad's own verified C_1808_4520Metric and C_2220_5750Metric footprints: since this case's 5.7mm length exactly matches C_2220_5750Metric's length, the pad depth/x-position was copied directly from that footprint; the y-axis side-fillet margin (~0.225mm, averaged from C_1808_4520Metric=0.25mm and C_2220_5750Metric=0.2mm) was applied to this case's 2.8mm width - please verify against Murata's datasheet before fab if it becomes available, generated 2026-08-27. 3D MODEL FIX (2026-08-27): the original .step used CSG BLOCK/CSG_SOLID primitives, which KiCad's OpenCASCADE-based STEP importer does not support - it silently failed to load. Regenerated as a proper B-Rep (MANIFOLD_SOLID_BREP) file with scripting/step_brep_box.py, same box geometry as before")
	(tags "capacitor MLCC safety X1 Y2 Murata GA3 GA352 5.7x2.8mm")
